1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
北京铜锅，锅底居然是清水
Beijing copper pot — the broth is plain water

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,600
不放辣，不放油，只加葱姜
No chili, no oil — just scallion and ginger

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,900
靠的是一口紫铜炭火锅
The secret: a copper charcoal pot

4
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,200
中间烟囱一冒，汤永远滚
The chimney keeps it forever boiling

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,500
羊肉切薄，七上八下就熟
Mutton sliced thin — a few dips, done

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,800
灵魂在蘸料：二八麻酱
The soul is the dip: sesame paste

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,100
二分花生，八分芝麻，澥开
Two parts peanut, eight parts sesame

8
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,400
再加韭菜花、酱豆腐、卤虾油
Plus chive flower, fermented tofu, shrimp oil

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,700
这一锅，涮了一百多年
This pot's been going 100+ years

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,000
1903年东来顺，摆摊起家
1903: Donglaishun began as a stall

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,300
清水见真章，北京话叫：敞亮！
Plain water, all heart — 'chǎngliàng'

12
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,600
下集完结：贵州酸汤，红汤新顶流
Finale: Guizhou sour soup — the new star
